                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi I
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I
              according to def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#InjectiveObjects"}
              are those for which the unique morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi I
                    %mover
