          %h3#graphs Graphs
          %p
            In the category of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/graphs"} graphs
            (directed, allowing loops and multiple edges between pairs of vertices), a graph
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
